"smart_sources:Laptop-Battlefield/LB-Refresh-Playbook.md": {"class_name":"SmartSource","last_read":{"hash":"ll9x9m","at":1792988356838},"embedding":{"history":[],"default":{"mf_ccarbz":{"file":"mf_ccarbz","file_i":274,"read_hash":"ll9x9m","at":1792988377083}}},"path":"Laptop-Battlefield/LB-Refresh-Playbook.md","last_import":{"mtime":1792982171460,"size":4164,"at":1792988357229,"hash":"ll9x9m"},"outlinks":[{"title":"| echo \"0 links\"\ndone\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Health Check (Daily)\n\n```bash\n# RAM & earlyoom\nfree -h && journalctl -u earlyoom --since=\"1 hour ago\" --no-pager\n# PSI\ncat /proc/pressure/memory; cat /proc/pressure/io; cat /proc/pressure/cpu\n# Disk scheduler\ncat /sys/block/sda/queue/scheduler\n# Docker\ndocker ps -a\n# Git dirty\ncd ~/labs/monitoring && git status --short\ncd ~/labs/monitoring/monitoring-laravel-prototype && git status --short\n```\n\n---\n\n#laptop-battlefield #playbook #refresh\n[[Home-Laptop-Battlefield","target":"' \"$f\" 2>/dev/null","line":125}],"metadata":{"tags":["#laptop-battlefield","#playbook","#refresh"]},"blocks_data":{"#---frontmatter---":{"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1xm476t","at":1792988356838},"key":"Laptop-Battlefield/LB-Refresh-Playbook.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,7],"size":157,"should_embed":false},"#LB-Refresh-Playbook — Perintah Read-Only untuk Recon Ulang":{"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"hep2sn","at":1792988356838},"key":"Laptop-Battlefield/LB-Refresh-Playbook.md#LB-Refresh-Playbook — Perintah Read-Only untuk Recon Ulang","lines":[9,150],"size":3991,"should_embed":false},"#LB-Refresh-Playbook — Perintah Read-Only untuk Recon Ulang#{1}":{"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"18gdixe","at":1792988356838},"key":"Laptop-Battlefield/LB-Refresh-Playbook.md#LB-Refresh-Playbook — Perintah Read-Only untuk Recon Ulang#{1}","lines":[11,14],"size":89,"should_embed":false},"#LB-Refresh-Playbook — Perintah Read-Only untuk Recon Ulang#Phase 0 — Scope":{"text":null,"length":0,"last_re